# Stranglethorn Vale (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and formulas whose SOURCE is
# physically in Stranglethorn Vale for a Horde player, verified against the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables).
# Fifty-eight recipes are vendor-sold in-zone (every buy line carries an npc
# pin to the exact in-zone vendor, Horde or neutral — no bare buys); seven
# more drop from narrow in-zone sources and nowhere else, or nearly nowhere
# else, in the data. The famous crab and omelet ship here: their only
# in-zone vendors are Horde-only (Nerrist and Uthok in Grom'gol). Recipes
# whose only in-zone vendor is Alliance-faction are excluded (Alterac rule,
# flipped — see docs/stranglethorn-horde-companions-inventory.md); every other
# Stranglethorn-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest
# records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover
# those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it
# cleanly. First Aid and Fishing have no in-zone Horde source, so that is
# stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/stranglethorn-horde-recipes
title Stranglethorn Vale (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns
levels 30-47
zone Stranglethorn Vale
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords stranglethorn, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking — Booty Bay (Kelsey Yance)

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 2664 -- Kelsey Yance (28.23, 74.34), Cook
  buy 6039 "Recipe: Giant Clam Scorcho" npc 2664
  buy 6369 "Recipe: Rockscale Cod" npc 2664
  buy 13940 "Recipe: Cooked Glossy Mightfish" npc 2664
