  buy 13943 "Recipe: Hot Smoked Bass" npc 2664
  buy 17062 "Recipe: Mithril Head Trout" npc 2664
  buy 21099 "Recipe: Smoked Sagefish" npc 2664
  buy 21219 "Recipe: Sagefish Delight" npc 2664
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

