step First Aid, Fishing — no Horde source

  note The data holds no First Aid or Fishing recipe sourced in Stranglethorn Vale for Horde players: no servable in-zone vendor sells one and no in-zone mob drops one. Blacksmithing and Engineering DO have in-zone Horde sources (Jutak/Zarena/Vharr plans, Knaz/Mazk/Gnaz/Crazk schematics), so neither is listed here. Polestar's own profession guides cover progression.
